<title>FRANCE: French 1996 reinsurance profits rise 37.5 pct.</title>
<headline>French 1996 reinsurance profits rise 37.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>French reinsurance sector profit rose 37.5 percent to 2.399 billion francs in 1996 from 1.744 billion in 1995, France's association of reinsurers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The return on equity was close to 10 percent, it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
